      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wakpala%2C_South_Dakota"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Wakpala is situated within the boundaries of the Standing Rock Sioux Reservation in northern South Dakota.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        18
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wakpala%2C_South_Dakota"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The annual Wakpala Wacipi dance or powwow takes place on the last weekend of August.",
